    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help ConeMan destroy bushes and shut up the inner voice telling him they're nasty aliens invading his neighborhood. Burst, blow out, run, and jump through the green busters, protecting streets from alien flora. Avoid obstacles, smash as many bushes as possible, and boost your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/6a537973ac3e8e697f605416047be630.poster.avif?t=1749576962\" width=616 height=42 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/6a537973ac3e8e697f605416047be630.webm?t=1749576962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/95658fba66143a78a19a14d97b38e108.poster.avif?t=1749576962\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/95658fba66143a78a19a14d97b38e108.webm?t=1749576962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ConeMan is a nervous guy who trusts no one and is suspicious about everything. He\u2019s always mumbling about conspiracies and strange coincidences. Lately, he\u2019s started seeing odd shapes in the bushes and shrubs around. Now, he's confident that the bushes are aliens in disguise and that the invasion has begun! Armed with nothing but a traffic cone on his head, he dives into the bushes, smashing them apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/faf0f7d6bec3da21f64e3e0d09108a54.poster.avif?t=1749576962\" width=616 height=42 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/faf0f7d6bec3da21f64e3e0d09108a54.webm?t=1749576962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/e463bdd43e5ea4461b6d540bf0cc0725.poster.avif?t=1749576962\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/e463bdd43e5ea4461b6d540bf0cc0725.webm?t=1749576962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your skills, choose your pace \u2014 whether you run cautiously or dash at full speed with numerous action perks you picked up \u2014 it's all about increasing points, smashing bushes, and having fun.  Collect 'Questions' tasks for a risky gambling boost that will push your score even higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/ab983355918e29a678561f170214d674.poster.avif?t=1749576962\" width=616 height=42 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/ab983355918e29a678561f170214d674.webm?t=1749576962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/8cd2088b0ec1e15a359ebf0184229c62.poster.avif?t=1749576962\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/8cd2088b0ec1e15a359ebf0184229c62.webm?t=1749576962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through bushes and obstacles to complete card tasks and unlock a collection of illustrations! With sharp control skills, get the high score, climb the global leaderboard, and compete with the best players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/95e201ada0d20c0112fde214d1bad688.poster.avif?t=1749576962\" width=616 height=42 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/95e201ada0d20c0112fde214d1bad688.webm?t=1749576962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/66b7998b2c6efe83978e65d9ed7ed8ba.poster.avif?t=1749576962\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/66b7998b2c6efe83978e65d9ed7ed8ba.webm?t=1749576962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the silly world of Cone Rush! The neighborhood is under attack and ConeMan's paranoia knows no bounds \u2014 the only way to stop it is by destroying alien bushes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/ce3fb64d8f0adecbe54ccd615a99f677.poster.avif?t=1749576962\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/ce3fb64d8f0adecbe54ccd615a99f677.webm?t=1749576962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is ConeMan just a madman? or is he humanity's last line of defense against an alien attack?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/c9f9a1140d863f98937a5ae4eeaa8877.poster.avif?t=1749576962\" width=616 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773370/extras/c9f9a1140d863f98937a5ae4eeaa8877.webm?t=1749576962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
